  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 图25上画出的是折线$A_1A_2A_3A_4A_5$.它是线段$A_1A_2$、$A_2A_3$、$A_3A_4$、$A_4A_5$的并集.这些线段中每一个都叫做折线的一段.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 23,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-25",
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 23,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 25",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 23,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "图26上画出了另外五种折线.图26的а、в、г上画出的是简单折线.简单折线按顺序不相邻的两段没有公共点.图26б、д不是简单折线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-26",
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 26",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果线段$A_1A_2,A_2A_3,\\cdots,A_{n-1}A_n(n>2)$当中，按顺序相邻两段不在一条直线上，而不相邻两段没有交点，那么这些线段的并集叫做简单折线$A_1A_2\\cdots A_n$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "点$A_1,A_2,\\cdots,A_n$叫做折线$A_1A_2\\cdots A_n$的顶点，点$A_1$和$A_n$叫做端点.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 折线各段的长度的和叫做折线的长度.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**12 定理（折线长定理）.简单折线的长大于它的两个端点间的距离.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们就由三段组成的折线证明这个定理（图27）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "已知：$A_1A_2A_3A_4$是简单折线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-27",
      "label": "图 27",
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 27",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 27",
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求证：$|A_1A_2|+|A_2A_3|+|A_3A_4|>|A_1A_4|$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明.点$A_1,A_2,A_3$不在一条直线上（它们是折线相邻两段的端点）.根据三角形不等式（第5小节），有",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|A_1A_3|<|A_1A_2|+|A_2A_3|$. (1)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 24,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0034#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据距离的第三条性质（第4小节），有",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|A_1A_3|+|A_3A_4|\\geqslant|A_1A_4|$. (2)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由不等式(1)，和$|A_1A_2|+|A_2A_3|$大于$|A_1A_3|$，所以可以用$|A_1A_2|+|A_2A_3|$代换不等式(2)中的被加项$|A_1A_3|$.代换以后，不等式(2)的左边变大，因此有",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|A_1A_2|+|A_2A_3|+|A_3A_4|>|A_1A_4|$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于由任意段组成的折线，可以类似地证明这条定理.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 图28上画出了几条闭折线，其中а、в、г是简单闭折线.б和д不是简单闭折线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-28",
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 28",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**简单折线**$A_1A_2\\cdots A_n(n>2)$和线段$A_nA_1$当中，如果相邻两段（按圆周排列顺序）不在一条直线上，而不相邻的两段没有公共点，那么$A_1A_2\\cdots A_n$和$A_nA_1$的并集叫做简单闭折线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**注** 以后我们提到折线时均指简单折线（闭折线或不闭折线）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0035#10"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
